  "ruleText": "Cor 207.01 Commencement of Hearing. A hearing shall be commenced by an order of the department giving notice to the parties as required by Cor 207.03.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Cor 200) #7447, eff 2-6-01; ss by #9382, INTERIM, eff 2-3-09, EXPIRES: 8-3-09; ss by #9507-A, eff 7-8-09; ss by #12501, eff 3-23-18",
